# PCO-349 fix pass 3, Important 9: this is the redaction graveyard. `drawbar-kb`'s
# supersede-to-redact operation deposits the PRE-redaction original here (see
# scripts/plugin.test.ts's "ported files carry no private-org identifiers" describe block).
# Once this file is tracked, a future redaction commit would silently publish the unredacted
# text IN THE SAME COMMIT that redacts it — and it would no longer stand out as a new `??`
# entry an operator might review before `git add -A`. Git history makes that unrecoverable.
# Never track it; the archive-scan tests in plugin.test.ts still cover it "when present" for
# local runs.
